},{"template":"flow","chapter":"The one-two punch","narration":"Thorsten's favorite trick is the one-two punch. Instead of cramming everything into the first prompt, he first asks the agent to find the relevant code. That loads the right files into its context. Then he makes the real request.","params":{"nodes":[{"label":"Prompt 1: find it","sub":"“Find where we handle uploads and how the avatar uploader works.”","kind":"human","at":"first asks"},{"label":"Context loads","sub":"the right files, read","kind":"agent","at":"loads"},{"label":"Prompt 2: the ask","sub":"“Now make uploads work the same way.”","kind":"human","at":"real request"}]},"start":78.956,"dur":15.161,"words":[{"text":"Thorsten's","s":79.256,"e":79.896},{"text":"favorite","s":80.096,"e":80.296},{"text":"trick","s":80.376,"e":80.616},{"text":"is","s":80.776,"e":80.856},{"text":"the","s":80.936,"e":81.016},{"text":"one-two","s":81.096,"e":81.576},{"text":"punch.","s":81.656,"e":82.056},{"text":"Instead","s":82.616,"e":82.936},{"text":"of","s":82.976,"e":83.016},{"text":"cramming","s":83.096,"e":83.496},{"text":"everything","s":83.576,"e":83.976},{"text":"into","s":84.096,"e":84.216},{"text":"the","s":84.256,"e":84.296},{"text":"first","s":84.456,"e":84.696},{"text":"prompt,","s":84.776,"e":85.416},{"text":"he","s":85.536,"e":85.656},{"text":"first","s":85.816,"e":85.976},{"text":"asks","s":86.056,"e":86.376},{"text":"the","s":86.416,"e":86.456},{"text":"agent","s":86.536,"e":86.776},{"text":"to","s":86.856,"e":86.936},{"text":"find","s":87.016,"e":87.176},{"text":"the","s":87.256,"e":87.296},{"text":"relevant","s":87.336,"e":87.736},{"text":"code.","s":87.936,"e":88.416},{"text":"That","s":88.696,"e":88.856},{"text":"loads","s":89.016,"e":89.176},{"text":"the","s":89.216,"e":89.256},{"text":"right","s":89.336,"e":89.576},{"text":"files","s":89.656,"e":89.976},{"text":"into","s":90.056,"e":90.216},{"text":"its","s":90.296,"e":90.376},{"text":"context.","s":90.456,"e":91.256},{"text":"Then","s":91.496,"e":91.816},{"text":"he","s":91.896,"e":91.976},{"text":"makes","s":92.056,"e":92.216},{"text":"the","s":92.296,"e":92.376},{"text":"real","s":92.456,"e":92.616},{"text":"request.","s":92.696,"e":93.496}]},{"template":"statement","chapter":"Show, don't describe","narration":"Notice how much work examples do. Simon Willison often tells the agent to imitate existing logic elsewhere in the project, instead of describing the rules. And Thorsten says ninety percent of his prompts include a screenshot: a bug, a design, a customer message. Pictures and examples are cheap, dense context.","params":{"text":"Point at an *example*. Paste a *screenshot*. Skip the essay.","sub":"“90% of my prompts have screenshots in them.” — Thorsten Ball","sub_at":"ninety","art":"eye","tone":"human","sync":false},"start":94.117,"dur":21.639,"words":[{"text":"Notice","s":94.417,"e":94.817},{"text":"how","s":94.897,"e":94.977},{"text":"much","s":95.057,"e":95.217},{"text":"work","s":95.377,"e":95.697},{"text":"examples","s":95.777,"e":96.417},{"text":"do.","s":96.577,"e":97.057},{"text":"Simon","s":97.377,"e":97.697},{"text":"Willison","s":97.777,"e":98.257},{"text":"often","s":98.337,"e":98.577},{"text":"tells","s":98.657,"e":98.897},{"text":"the","s":98.937,"e":98.977},{"text":"agent","s":99.057,"e":99.377},{"text":"to","s":99.417,"e":99.457},{"text":"imitate","s":99.617,"e":100.097},{"text":"existing","s":100.377,"e":100.657},{"text":"logic","s":100.737,"e":101.137},{"text":"elsewhere","s":101.217,"e":101.617},{"text":"in","s":101.657,"e":101.697},{"text":"the","s":101.737,"e":101.777},{"text":"project,","s":101.857,"e":102.497},{"text":"instead","s":102.697,"e":102.897},{"text":"of","s":102.937,"e":102.977},{"text":"describing","s":103.057,"e":103.537},{"text":"the","s":103.577,"e":103.617},{"text":"rules.","s":103.697,"e":104.337},{"text":"And","s":104.577,"e":104.737},{"text":"Thorsten","s":104.817,"e":105.217},{"text":"says","s":105.297,"e":105.537},{"text":"ninety","s":105.777,"e":106.017}